{#
    语录排行榜 HTML 模板
    该模板模板定义排行榜页面布局，包含左侧的贡献排行榜、中间的趋势分析图表和右侧的整体统计信息。


    echarts_js: echarts 库绝对路径
    rank_css: 排行榜样式绝对路径
    rank_js: 排行榜脚本绝对路径


    group_name: 群组名称字符串
    date_time: 时间字符串


    max_avatar_threshold: 整数，当排行榜用户数超过该值时，不显示头像以节省空间
    basic_ranking_data: 排行榜基本数据字典
        example:
            [
                { rank: 1, name: "Alex", score: 1050, avatar: "..." },
                { rank: 2, name: "Bella", score: 980, avatar: "..." },
                { rank: 3, name: "Chris", score: 925, avatar: "..." },
                { rank: 4, name: "Diana", score: 880, avatar: "..." },
                ...
            ]
        要求给定: rank, name, score, avatar (可以为 Base64 或 URL)
    

    line_chart_data: 折线图数据字典
        example:
            {
                "topN": 5,
                "dates": ["10-1", "10-2", "10-3", "10-4", "10-5", "10-6", "10-7", "10-8", "10-9", "10-10"],
                "seriesData": [
                    [995, 988, 1002, 1015, 1008, 1022, 1035, 1028, 1042, 1055],
                    [945, 938, 952, 965, 958, 972, 985, 978, 992, 1005],
                    [895, 888, 902, 915, 908, 922, 935, 928, 942, 955],
                    [845, 838, 852, 865, 858, 872, 885, 878, 892, 905],
                    [795, 788, 802, 815, 808, 822, 835, 828, 842, 855]
                ]
            }
        topN 表示显示前 N 名用户的趋势，dates 为日期列表，需要有顺序，seriesData 为每个对应用户的语录统计数量列表
        注意这里的 seriesData 顺序必须和 basic_ranking_data 保持一致
    
    
    stat_data: 统计数据字典
        example:
            [
                { value: 128, label: "活跃用户" },
                { value: 8421, label: "总贡献点" },
                { value: "+12.5%", label: "月增长率" }
            ]
        会按照顺序显示在右侧统计栏
#}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>语录排行榜 / {{ group_name }}</title>
    
    <script src="{{ echarts_js | safe }}"></script>
    <link href="{{ rank_css | safe }}" rel="stylesheet">

    <!-- 排行榜基本数据 Json -->
    <script type="application/json" id="leaderboard-data">
    {{ basic_ranking_data | tojson }}
    </script>

    <!-- 统计数据 Json -->
    <script type="application/json" id="stats-data">
    {{ stat_data | tojson }}
    </script>

    <!-- 折线图 Json -->
    <script type="application/json" id="chart-config">
    {{ line_chart_data | tojson }}
    </script>

    <!-- 其他配置 Json -->
    <script type="application/json" id="app-config">
    {% raw %} { {% endraw %}
        "maxAvatarThreshold": {{ max_avatar_threshold }},
    {% raw %} } {% endraw %}
    </script>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="dashboard-window">
        <aside class="sidebar-left">
            <h2>贡献排行</h2>
            <ol class="leaderboard-list" id="leaderboard"></ol>
        </aside>
        <main class="main-content">
            <h2>排行走势 (To {{ date_time }})</h2>
            <div id="main-chart"></div>
        </main>
        <aside class="sidebar-right">
            <h2>整体统计</h2>
            <div id="stats-container" class="stats-container"></div>
        </aside>
    </div>

    <script src="{{ rank_js | safe }}"></script>
</body>
</html>
